WEBVTT

00:00.580 --> 00:09.437
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.580 --> 00:09.437
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.950 --> 00:18.522
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.950 --> 00:18.522
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.664 --> 00:37.239
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.664 --> 00:37.239
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.613 --> 00:46.799
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.613 --> 00:46.800
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.033 --> 00:56.166
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.033 --> 00:56.167
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.326 --> 01:05.433
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.326 --> 01:05.433
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.782 --> 01:14.830
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.789 --> 01:14.830
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.850 --> 01:22.825
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.850 --> 01:22.825
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.758 --> 01:30.678
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.597 --> 01:33.932
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.808 --> 01:35.851
Black Jack.

02:32.325 --> 02:33.659
Luna Luna...

02:40.118 --> 02:43.224
Originally by Tezuka Osamu - White Lion

02:40.118 --> 02:43.225
White Lion

02:44.313 --> 02:48.066
Two tickets, please.

02:48.276 --> 02:50.444
You know, like a married couple!

02:50.445 --> 02:51.698
Sorry.

02:52.155 --> 02:53.968
We'll take one adult and one kid.

02:55.116 --> 02:56.700
Let's see...

02:56.701 --> 02:59.036
There he is!

03:00.970 --> 03:01.997
Over there!

03:04.876 --> 03:07.711
We've got to see him right now!

03:09.839 --> 03:10.999
Found him!

03:21.392 --> 03:25.614
Luna Luna is not feeling well, so
he will be away for a while.

03:28.816 --> 03:30.609
What's going on?

03:30.610 --> 03:32.986
We came a long way to see him.

03:32.987 --> 03:34.446
I'm terribly sorry.

03:34.822 --> 03:36.239
Luna Luna!

03:36.240 --> 03:37.574
Give it up.

03:39.577 --> 03:41.953
Hey, is Luna Luna sick?

03:43.206 --> 03:44.831
Sorry, Miss.

03:44.832 --> 03:48.351
Then my Doc can heal him.

03:48.795 --> 03:50.031
Doc?

03:50.213 --> 03:53.382
Is your father a veterinarian?

03:53.383 --> 03:55.384
Not my father!

03:55.385 --> 03:57.886
Don't you know Dr. Black Jack?!

03:58.930 --> 04:00.806
Black...

04:00.807 --> 04:01.848
Pinoco, let's go.

04:06.104 --> 04:08.199
Are you really Dr. Black Jack?

04:08.481 --> 04:09.606
Yes, and you are?

04:09.899 --> 04:14.736
I take care of Luna Luna here.

04:14.737 --> 04:16.822
Would you please look at him?

04:17.782 --> 04:19.286
Doc?

04:19.659 --> 04:22.810
I'm sorry, but my specialty is people.

04:23.037 --> 04:24.705
A lion is outside my field of expertise.

04:24.998 --> 04:25.998
Why?

04:25.999 --> 04:28.875
You've even saved cats and dogs.

04:28.876 --> 04:30.335
Please wait!

04:30.962 --> 04:33.394
I have heard about you.

04:33.715 --> 04:38.051
I've tried every doctor in the country in order to save him.

04:38.594 --> 04:40.762
Even you.

04:41.264 --> 04:46.226
Then you should know that I ask for an,outrageous fee.

04:46.227 --> 04:48.937
Can you or the zoo pay it?

04:50.231 --> 04:51.148
Excuse me.

04:58.114 --> 05:00.782
Wait up, Doc!

05:12.587 --> 05:13.837
See you tomorrow.

05:13.838 --> 05:15.005
Take care.

05:23.723 --> 05:25.655
He's being scolded again,

05:25.850 --> 05:28.310
Yeah, on top of the all-night work.

05:29.020 --> 05:30.698
I paid a high price!

05:30.897 --> 05:33.275
And what we got is defective!

05:33.566 --> 05:37.272
Sir, he got sick after he came to Japan.

05:37.570 --> 05:38.862
I doubt that!

05:40.281 --> 05:41.948
Man, at this rate...

05:41.949 --> 05:43.342
So I'd like to ask

05:43.743 --> 05:47.621
Dr. Black Jack to treat him.

05:48.706 --> 05:50.123
Black Jack?!

05:50.667 --> 05:54.652
That underground doctor who
charges some crazy amount?!

05:55.046 --> 05:57.714
Since he's known for his unbelievable skill...

05:57.213 --> 05:58.450
Don't kid me!

05:58.716 --> 06:00.092
I can't spend any more on him!

06:01.135 --> 06:03.095
Give up already.

06:09.977 --> 06:11.692
All white!

06:11.938 --> 06:13.814
I'm busy right now.

06:18.695 --> 06:20.070
What?

06:20.071 --> 06:21.822
Hey, wha...

06:31.541 --> 06:33.875
Oh, the Luna Luna man.

06:40.633 --> 06:43.719
Doc, the Luna Luna man is here.

06:44.303 --> 06:45.721
The Luna Luna man?

06:45.722 --> 06:46.304
Yeah.

06:50.601 --> 06:51.645
Please go.

06:51.853 --> 06:53.323
I declined the other day.

06:53.730 --> 06:55.084
I finally found you.

06:55.356 --> 06:56.565
Please.

06:56.566 --> 06:58.233
At this rate, Luna Luna will be...

06:58.943 --> 07:04.031
No matter what happens to the animals
at your place, it's none of my business.

07:11.914 --> 07:14.333
Good.

07:16.002 --> 07:17.294
Doctor...

07:19.505 --> 07:20.881
Don't push yourself.

07:22.050 --> 07:24.843
You had temporary anemia from stress.

07:26.346 --> 07:28.013
I don't care about myself.

07:28.014 --> 07:33.060
Please save Luna Luna, not me!

07:35.688 --> 07:37.022
30,000,000.

07:37.690 --> 07:41.610
I'll take 30,000,090 yen as the fee.

07:42.570 --> 07:44.863
30,000,000 yen?

07:48.993 --> 07:50.744
Oh, wai...

07:52.497 --> 07:53.997
Wait.

07:54.165 --> 07:55.499
I'll discuss it with the-zoo curator.

07:55.500 --> 08:00.676
And if that doesn't work, I will pay somehow!

08:01.047 --> 08:02.255
Doc!

08:03.758 --> 08:05.605
Please rest for today.

08:06.052 --> 08:10.138
Fine, I'll visit the zoo with you tomorrow.

08:11.224 --> 08:12.557
Yay!

08:12.934 --> 08:14.769
I love you, Doc!

08:14.018 --> 08:15.102
Hey, Pinoco!

08:18.606 --> 08:21.920
Luna Luna is really such a poor thing.

08:22.360 --> 08:24.161
He has no parents or friends.

08:24.529 --> 08:29.491
Just because he's a rare white lion, he's
constantly being sold by one place to another.

08:30.326 --> 08:33.412
When he came here, he was very scared.

08:33.788 --> 08:36.790
But for some reason, he befriended me.

08:37.375 --> 08:42.629
Then I started loving him like my own child.

08:49.470 --> 08:53.724
But after a while, his appetite started waning,

08:53.725 --> 08:55.434
and he didn't sleep much,

08:55.435 --> 08:57.580
and he continues to weaken each day.

09:00.023 --> 09:01.148
Over here.

09:03.693 --> 09:05.363
Luna Luna!

09:05.435 --> 09:06.403
Be quiet.

09:11.784 --> 09:13.839
Poor Luna Luna.

09:14.329 --> 09:15.954
Can I see his past medical records?

09:17.123 --> 09:19.499
I don't know how much longer he'll last.

09:20.418 --> 09:23.063
Doctor, please find a way to save him.

09:24.005 --> 09:27.257
He has cirrhosis, pancreatitis, and a weak heart.

09:27.884 --> 09:30.093
We can treat him medically,

09:30.720 --> 09:34.723
but unless we find the root of these problems,

09:34.724 --> 09:36.266
the symptoms will only return.

09:37.602 --> 09:38.821
Doctor...

09:39.437 --> 09:41.213
I will look after him at my place.

09:41.589 --> 09:42.782
Yay!

09:43.103 --> 09:44.322
But wait!

09:44.817 --> 09:47.049
The zoo curator is out of town today, so...

09:47.056 --> 09:48.644
Fine.

09:48.663 --> 09:49.663
No way.

09:49.783 --> 09:52.324
We should at least contact the curator, and...

09:52.325 --> 09:53.325
It's fine!

09:53.993 --> 09:56.119
I'll take full responsibility.

09:56.371 --> 09:58.038
Yay!

09:58.039 --> 09:59.873
Together with Luna Luna!

10:00.124 --> 10:02.459
What in the world is this?!

10:02.710 --> 10:07.547
We can't spend any more money on
a lion we can't show to visitors!

10:07.548 --> 10:08.382
But...

10:08.800 --> 10:11.684
This is all your fault!

10:12.053 --> 10:14.513
I will have nothing to do with this!

10:15.473 --> 10:19.351
Doc, what do you think Luna Luna will want to eat?

10:19.352 --> 10:20.394
I don't know...

10:20.395 --> 10:22.896
He's a lion, so I'm sure he eats meat.

10:22.897 --> 10:25.982
Then curry sounds good.

10:25.983 --> 10:28.026
Or hamburger.

10:28.027 --> 10:30.857
Or pasta, or fried rice...

10:29.846 --> 10:31.571
I get it, so get out of this room,

10:32.532 --> 10:33.865
You're interrupting my work.

10:39.122 --> 10:41.832
It's time for lunch.

10:41.833 --> 10:45.544
It's all for you, Luna Luna-chan.

10:45.545 --> 10:47.754
You should eat all of it.

10:47.755 --> 10:49.316
What the heck is this?

10:49.507 --> 10:51.868
It's Luna Luna's lunch.

10:52.093 --> 10:52.926
See?

10:52.927 --> 10:57.848
Curry, pasta, hot cake, hot juice, hot apples.

10:58.641 --> 10:59.891
Pinoco-chan, let's play.

11:01.060 --> 11:02.561
It's Luna Luna!

11:02.854 --> 11:04.393
Wow!

11:04.478 --> 11:05.718
So cute!

11:05.064 --> 11:06.398
He's eating lunch.

11:06.399 --> 11:07.858
Don't disturb him.

11:07.859 --> 11:11.069
He can have the leftovers from my lunch.

11:11.070 --> 11:13.109
He won't eat that!

11:13.281 --> 11:15.657
My cooking would be better.

11:15.658 --> 11:18.056
He'll get sick.

11:18.536 --> 11:21.163
What did you just say?!

11:21.368 --> 11:23.081
Enough already!

11:24.388 --> 11:25.388
Come here.

11:25.626 --> 11:30.291
It's cold tonight, so I'll give Luna Luna a shirt.

11:30.548 --> 11:31.902
Fine.

11:33.855 --> 11:35.385
How about this?

11:35.986 --> 11:36.874
This?

11:38.032 --> 11:39.032
This?

11:41.142 --> 11:43.101
It's Luna Luna's turn right now.

11:43.102 --> 11:44.936
Wait.

11:46.105 --> 11:47.606
You got something to say?

11:51.912 --> 11:53.299
Fine!

11:53.359 --> 11:55.947
Ippon-zeoi!

12:27.131 --> 12:28.757
He's gone!

12:30.134 --> 12:30.535
What's wrong?!

12:30.561 --> 12:31.718
Luna Luna is...

12:31.719 --> 12:33.845
gone!

12:35.765 --> 12:36.806
One, two!

12:36.933 --> 12:37.974
One, two!

12:38.059 --> 12:39.142
One, two!

12:39.226 --> 12:40.260
One, two!

12:43.147 --> 12:44.481
I give up.

12:45.149 --> 12:48.652
That's why Kong bullies you all the time.

12:47.832 --> 12:49.110
Sharaku!

12:51.155 --> 12:53.073
Luna Luna is gone?!

12:53.449 --> 12:56.916
Luna Luna?! Where are you?!

12:57.161 --> 12:58.203
Luna Luna!

12:58.246 --> 13:00.997
Hey! Luna Luna!

13:01.415 --> 13:02.749
Luna Luna?

13:05.253 --> 13:06.169
Luna Luna!

13:18.432 --> 13:20.392
That's funny as hell!

13:20.393 --> 13:22.185
What are you doing up there?

13:22.770 --> 13:24.437
Training for something?

13:29.694 --> 13:30.993
What?!

13:37.952 --> 13:39.848
Damn you!

13:44.834 --> 13:47.544
You think I'd let that go?!

13:55.970 --> 13:57.971
We're home.

14:01.350 --> 14:03.143
Luna Luna!

14:04.770 --> 14:06.313
Thank goodness!

14:11.485 --> 14:14.779
But why isn't Luna Luna getting better?

14:15.615 --> 14:18.450
A digestive malfunction will be cured with an operation.

14:19.619 --> 14:20.994
But the problem is after that.

14:22.371 --> 14:25.248
But Luna Luna is really really white.

14:25.249 --> 14:28.251
Yeah, white is really cute.

14:35.217 --> 14:37.510
Wait!

14:38.846 --> 14:40.764
Wait, Largo!

14:48.773 --> 14:51.316
Pinoco, that's enough.

14:52.443 --> 14:54.361
We painted Largo white too.

14:55.863 --> 14:57.948
We did it with flour.

14:57.949 --> 15:00.535
We wanted to know if she'd be cute in white.

15:00.868 --> 15:02.263
You guys...

15:02.662 --> 15:05.497
Luna Luna was white ever since he was born...

15:06.832 --> 15:07.999
<i>He was white?!</i>

15:08.626 --> 15:10.460
<i>No, that's a big misunderstanding!</i>

15:12.755 --> 15:16.007
You have saved us many times,
so we'll make this exception.

15:16.676 --> 15:20.428
Jeez, checking a lion with an MRI?

15:21.055 --> 15:22.347
The picture is coming up.

15:26.686 --> 15:28.645
Zoom in on the bottom right image.

15:28.646 --> 15:29.271
Yes.

15:31.649 --> 15:32.482
As I thought.

15:33.359 --> 15:35.610
That looks like a tumor.

15:36.645 --> 15:37.645
I see!

15:40.783 --> 15:41.794
Not your problem?

15:42.118 --> 15:43.159
No.

15:43.160 --> 15:45.453
So you don't care what happens to that lion?

15:45.454 --> 15:46.079
No.

15:46.080 --> 15:49.624
We can't spend 30,000,000 yen on a dying lion.

15:49.625 --> 15:50.684
Mr. Curator!

15:52.128 --> 15:54.212
I've already given up on that lion.

15:54.213 --> 15:55.714
You can have him.

15:56.299 --> 15:57.299
Fine.

15:59.510 --> 16:02.721
I heard you right, Mr. Curator.

16:08.936 --> 16:11.878
Doc, will Luna Luna get better?

16:12.565 --> 16:14.774
So, you're really operating on him?

16:14.775 --> 16:15.510
Yeah.

16:15.818 --> 16:19.014
But an operation isn't enough to cure him completely.

16:19.780 --> 16:22.198
Luna Luna was not a white lion by birth.

16:22.783 --> 16:27.078
The tumor by the pituitary gland weakened
the activity of the melanin cells,

16:27.079 --> 16:29.122
causing his fur to become white.

16:29.123 --> 16:31.791
So he's white because of the illness?

16:31.792 --> 16:32.535
That's right.

16:32.793 --> 16:35.262
But the weakened internal organs are a different issue.

16:36.422 --> 16:39.966
Because he's a rare white lion, he was always a showpiece.

16:40.551 --> 16:42.677
The stress from that is the cause of the illness.

16:43.804 --> 16:47.454
So we must eliminate the tumor, and
turn his color back to normal.

16:47.725 --> 16:49.100
What will happen then?

16:49.101 --> 16:51.686
Will Luna Luna become a normal lion?

16:51.687 --> 16:52.406
Yes.

16:52.688 --> 16:54.689
And we'll release him in his homeland.

16:55.191 --> 16:56.926
He'll be free from humans forever.

16:59.695 --> 17:02.510
No!

17:09.163 --> 17:10.840
Pinoco! Sharaku!

17:11.165 --> 17:14.793
I can't let go of Luna Luna, even for you, Doc!

17:14.794 --> 17:17.576
I don't want to return Luna Luna to his home!

17:18.381 --> 17:20.602
What if you were Luna Luna?

17:21.801 --> 17:23.703
You will live alone forever.

17:24.011 --> 17:25.095
Are you fine with that?

17:29.141 --> 17:33.270
Wouldn't you want to get better and go home?

17:34.063 --> 17:36.805
Wouldn't you want to run through
the savannah all you could?

17:37.108 --> 17:39.651
Well, sure.

17:42.196 --> 17:45.907
I'm sure Luna Luna feels that way too.

17:59.880 --> 18:04.017
We're commencing the operation to remove
the tumor next to the pituitary gland.

18:05.803 --> 18:08.263
It's for Luna Luna's good.

18:09.015 --> 18:12.875
<i>Dear God, please save Luna Luna.</i>

18:26.157 --> 18:28.909
I apologize about the other day.

18:28.910 --> 18:33.705
If he's cured completely, I will pay the appropriate fee.

18:34.832 --> 18:37.751
How is Luna Luna recovering?

18:37.752 --> 18:40.295
Wait, Luna Luna!

18:46.844 --> 18:48.098
Luna Luna?!

18:48.387 --> 18:50.263
W-What?!

18:55.728 --> 18:57.613
What is going on?!

18:57.939 --> 18:58.891
Luna Luna!

19:00.274 --> 19:04.152
His fur turned gold after the treatment.

19:04.153 --> 19:06.238
How absurd!

19:06.739 --> 19:10.242
That's just a regular lion, the same as all the others!

19:10.243 --> 19:11.379
Black Jack!

19:11.535 --> 19:13.912
You told me I could do whatever I wanted.

19:16.832 --> 19:19.084
You're fired, effective immediately!

19:19.502 --> 19:23.880
You can have him as your retirement fund!

19:25.466 --> 19:27.968
It was my mistake to let him take care of it.

19:31.764 --> 19:33.266
Come here, Luna Luna!

19:37.019 --> 19:39.896
I'm so glad you've gotten better.

19:40.982 --> 19:43.400
Thank you very much, doctor.

19:44.443 --> 19:46.861
So, about the fee...

19:47.405 --> 19:50.240
I'm sorry, but I only have this much right now.

19:50.783 --> 19:51.324
No.

19:51.325 --> 19:56.830
Someone needs to take Luna Luna to his
home, Africa, to cure him completely.

19:57.582 --> 19:59.749
Besides, he must be trained to
be with Mother Nature again.

20:00.459 --> 20:03.670
Oh yes, what if you take care of him?

20:05.256 --> 20:07.215
No, I won't ask you to do it for free.

20:07.216 --> 20:09.226
30,000,000 yen, including general expenses.

20:09.552 --> 20:10.497
How is that?

20:13.681 --> 20:15.640
Dr. Black Jack...

20:16.142 --> 20:17.142
It's a deal.

20:18.394 --> 20:19.728
Take care.

20:31.282 --> 20:33.742
Take care, Luna Luna.

20:34.535 --> 20:36.953
We'll come see you some day.

20:37.413 --> 20:39.275
What? He went back?

20:39.457 --> 20:41.291
We can't see him anymore?

20:41.292 --> 20:44.461
Oh, man, that's disappointing.

20:44.462 --> 20:46.421
There's no point coming here anymore.

20:46.422 --> 20:48.214
Who operated on him, huh?

20:48.215 --> 20:49.424
Man.

20:49.425 --> 20:51.676
Must have been some quack.

20:54.180 --> 20:56.640
Wow, there's so many!

20:57.016 --> 20:59.517
Hey, are they all requests for work?

20:59.518 --> 21:01.853
Or are they fan letters to me?

21:01.854 --> 21:02.854
Just kidding!

21:02.936 --> 21:06.475
The letters if complaints were delivered
to the zoo, all from Luna Luna fans.

21:06.692 --> 21:07.609
Addressed to me.

21:11.572 --> 21:13.490
WHAT?!

21:18.120 --> 21:21.498
Doc saved Luna Luna!

21:28.506 --> 21:29.881
Hey, Doc,

21:30.508 --> 21:34.469
I found a letter from a kid in that pile.

21:34.470 --> 21:34.970
Here.

21:42.561 --> 21:45.480
Pinoco, you drew this, didn't you?

21:46.708 --> 21:48.650
No, I didn't.

22:07.077 --> 22:19.032
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.077 --> 22:19.032
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.150 --> 22:24.149
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.150 --> 22:24.149
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.718 --> 22:31.187
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.718 --> 22:31.187
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.731 --> 22:37.189
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.731 --> 22:37.189
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.793 --> 22:40.278
being heated up by you,

22:37.793 --> 22:40.278
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.487 --> 22:48.264
so much that I change color

22:40.487 --> 22:48.264
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.349 --> 23:00.118
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.349 --> 23:00.118
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.326 --> 23:12.057
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.326 --> 23:12.057
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.297 --> 23:23.648
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.297 --> 23:23.648
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.834 --> 23:28.755
I couldn't be happier

23:23.834 --> 23:28.755
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:28.983 --> 23:33.917
How does it taste?

23:28.983 --> 23:33.916
oaji wa ikaga?

23:45.090 --> 24:14.876
The Miracle Arm

23:45.389 --> 23:47.432
Please become my hand.

23:48.226 --> 23:49.101
Your hand?

23:49.477 --> 23:50.102
Go!

23:53.106 --> 23:55.690
I won't come home until
I become a pro!

23:55.816 --> 23:58.777
